{
    "background_story": "Jorge was a socialite known for his stunning looks and charming smile. He spent most of his days lounging by the pool, sipping cocktails, and attending high-end parties. But beneath his glamorous facade, Jorge's life was surprisingly shallow. He had few genuine relationships, and his conversations rarely delved deeper than the latest fashion trends or celebrity gossip. Jorge's obsession with his physical appearance led him to spend hours in front of the mirror, perfecting his tan and hair. Despite his wealth and popularity, he felt unfulfilled and empty inside. Jorge's shallow existence was a facade that hid his own insecurities and lack of purpose. As he approached his 30s, he began to wonder if there was more to life than just superficial pleasures.",
